hero_eyebrow: Hello! Welcome
---
hero_heading: I'm Dario Guzmán.
---
hero_tagline: Python Developer · Barranquilla, Colombia
---
hero_lede:

I've been building scalable APIs and web applications with Django for **10+ years**.
I currently lead the live streaming team at [Roboduels](/en/cv),
co-organize [Python Barranquilla](/en/cv),
write about what I learn on [my blog](/en/blog),
and run free workshops with [Django Girls Colombia](/en/workshops).
---
worked_at_subtitle: 10+ years in product and consulting
